WEBVTT

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.hook-1
00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:02.633 line:78% position:50% align:center
A wood frog can survive a freeze

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.hook-2
00:00:02.633 --> 00:00:04.067 line:78% position:50% align:center
that stops its heartbeat—then

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.hook-3
00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.167 line:78% position:50% align:center
thaw and recover.

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.freeze-1
00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:08.033 line:78% position:50% align:center
Much of its body water can turn to ice,

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.freeze-2
00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:09.300 line:78% position:50% align:center
mainly outside its cells.

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.location-1
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.067 line:78% position:50% align:center
As extracellular ice grows,

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.location-2
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:12.833 line:78% position:50% align:center
water leaves the cells.

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.location-3
00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:14.600 line:78% position:50% align:center
That dehydration helps keep

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.location-4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.700 line:78% position:50% align:center
dangerous ice crystals from forming inside them.

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.chemistry-1
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.700 line:78% position:50% align:center
Its liver rapidly releases glucose,

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.chemistry-2
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.900 line:78% position:50% align:center
while urea has already built up before freezing.

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.protection-1
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.067 line:78% position:50% align:center
These cryoprotectants limit ice formation

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.protection-2
00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:28.500 line:78% position:50% align:center
and help protect cells through freezing and thawing.

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.payoff-1
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.267 line:78% position:50% align:center
As the frog thaws,

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.payoff-2
00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:32.467 line:78% position:50% align:center
its heart starts beating first;

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.payoff-3
00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:34.667 line:78% position:50% align:center
breathing and leg reflexes follow.

caption-plan.wood-frog.v1.payoff-4
00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:38.633 line:78% position:50% align:center
It survived by controlling the freeze—not by staying unfrozen.
